            "review_title": "Review at Ryoshi Sushi Ikeikemaru",
            "review_text": "Plu711\nMelbourne, Australia76 contributions\n0\nNice place with well priced food but a wait in line.\nFeb 2019 • Friends\nCame here with 1 other. We had to wait in a line due to how busy it was. Some people cut in front of us at times and the line wasn't being monitored so they managed to get in before us. When a spot became available we were walked to our table. Then the rest is self explanatory. There are 2 pieces per plate. Pricing is reasonable and good quality compared to what I'm used to. There was some wait at times due to one want not on the belt. But either way good nice food in a nice atmosphere. I would recommend for the experience and the food. The price is good for tourists too. Will be back next time I'm in Ho Chi Minh City.\nRead more\nWritten February 26, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
