            "review_title": "Review at Ryoshi Sushi Ikeikemaru",
            "review_text": "Eric P\nPereira, Colombia147 contributions\n0\nSnacks & Draft Sapporo in Saigon Centre\nDec 2018 • Couples\nIt's a place to eat light snacks & drink draft Sapporo. the stuff on the belt is all 25 dong. The draft Sappoices. oro is 30 dong. How wrong can you go for a quick visit. If you want to eat Sushi, go to the Japanese area in District 1. It's a 10 minute walk and there are so many good choices. All the places in Saigon Centre are fast food.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 23, 2018",
