            "review_text": "Tai Tran\n1 contribution\n0\nHorrible\nSep 2018 • Solo\nIt is fair to say that you can not get the good quality sushi with only 25000 per dish, but cmon there are only two pieces on the plate. If I do the math right, it is not cheaper than any other sushi restaurants. However, the quality is below average. The ramen taste like instant paste that I bought at supermarket, there was nothing fresh and authentic here. I'd rather pay a little bit more to have decent food not this disgusting food.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 16, 2018",
