            "review_title": "Review at Ryoshi Sushi Ikeikemaru",
            "review_text": "Leonieke v\nAmsterdam, The Netherlands97 contributions\n0\nWe ate too much! It was tasty!\nApr 2018 • Couples\nWe liked the place a lot. Returned on our 3 day trip in hcmc. \nIt wasnt veey busy, service was good and the assortment of sushis was broad and for an acceptable price. Everything on the conveyer beld was 25.000 dong and there were more options on the menu to order seperately. \nSushis were fresh, not too cold and tasty. Service was adequate and friendly. \n\nRecommended!\nRead more\nWritten April 13, 2018",
